dialogue prologue_wake
title: Cold Open
trigger: Prologue Wake
backdrop: greenvalley
speaker commander $commander
speaker knight knight
speaker barbarian barbarian

node cold commander
  A heartbeat, slow and far away. Frost cracks on the glass in front of your face.
  -> light

node light commander
  Cold. Then light. Then voices.
  -> door

node door barbarian
  Put your back into it. The door's half open and the slimes are already in the pipes.
  -> lights

node lights knight
  Wait. The lamps in here just came on. Who's down there?
